##==============================================================================
## Finalization - Make Configuration Immutable
##==============================================================================
## IMPORTANT: These rules MUST be last in the audit configuration
## Once these are set, the audit configuration cannot be changed without reboot

## Make audit configuration immutable
## This prevents any changes to audit rules until the system is rebooted
-e 2

## Make login UIDs immutable
## This prevents users from changing their audit identity
--loginuid-immutable
